  "limitations": [
    "Forty selected output frames cover introduction, quiet lead, simultaneous lead/backing, sustained words, multiple original shots and the final held picture; they are not an exhaustive whole-recording byte comparison.",
    "Cache reuse requires the same source-frame index and immutable decoder buffer identity. A changed buffer or source frame performs the complete ordinary background paint.",
    "The helper supports only the current approved portrait background sequence, asserts one full clear, two source draws and three full fills, and requires a completely opaque cache.",
    "Every native context state operation and dynamic lyric/signal draw is forwarded; the approved scene and selected timing remain unchanged.",
    "Encoded-film source/audio/focus verification remains required after this optimization; sampled cache parity is not listening evidence."
  ],
